    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……この薫りは……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...This scent...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ティアの花です。
娘さんの依頼で、
取ってきたんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a Tear's Flower.
Your daughter asked
us to bring it to you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>娘が……
メモリーが……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My daughter... Memorie
asked you to...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>娘さん言ってたぜ、
母ちゃんとの思い出の花
だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She said it's full of memories
for you guys.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから母ちゃんに
見せてやってくれって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So she wanted us to
show one to you.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271912</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どう、したんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...What? Something wrong...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>思い出の花、だなんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Full of memories... Really...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その花はある種の液体に
溶かすと、とんでもない
薬を作ることができるのさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you dissolve it with a
certain liquid, that flower
makes a terrible drug.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人をダメにする
悪魔の薬……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A drug straight from
the devil. It ruins people.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あたしは昔、
薬草使いだった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Many years ago, I
was an herbalist.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>色々悪いことをやった……
あたしはヒドイ女だった。
生きるためにはなんでもやった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I did a lot of awful things...
I was a cruel woman. I'd
do anything to keep living.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、娘だけには
いい母親と思ってほしかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I wanted, at the least,
for my daughter to think
I was a good mother.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>メモリーは……娘は、
こんな花を思い出の花だと……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Memorie...my daughter said this
flower's full of memories for her?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あたしが、薬を
売りさばくために集めた
こんな花を思い出の花だと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This flower I gathered just
so I could sell drugs? That's
her "flower full of memories"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272540</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごめんよ……メモリー……
かあさんを……許しとくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm so sorry...Memorie...
Please forgive your mother...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272620</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>せっかく、
喜ばしてあげよう
って思ったのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We went out of our way,
so I thought she'd be
really happy, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272668</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ふ、ふたりとも、
元気だして！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Ch-Cheer up, you two!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>少なくとも、
娘さんは
喜んでたでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if it was just
a little, at least the
daughter was happy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272824</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう、だけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's true, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……お母さんも、
例え、あの花が
嫌な思い出の花でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And the mother... Even
if her memories of that
flower were bad...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>娘さんがいつまでも
同じような気持ちで自分を
想っていてくれるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Her daughter has always
seen her the same way,
no matter what she's done.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きっとわかったはずだよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm sure she understands that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そうだな、うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah, that's true.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうかな……そうだと、
いい、ね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is it...? It'd be
nice if it were...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
